From b1c353f08305193b62c6e61695a6261a6c7fb80d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:11:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] windowing/gbm, estuary: the output depth during native Dolby
 Vision says that 8 bits carry its 12
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

During native Dolby Vision the overview page of the player information
said, on NVIDIA, "Output depth: 8 bits (fixed)" (#31867) under the
Transport row, "RGB 8-bit · DV 12-bit 4:2:2" (#31828); a user asked
whether he had to change something to get 12 bits. On i915 and amdgpu
the row said "up to N bits" from "max bpc", which reads as a limit too.
It is right that the link carries 8 bits: Dolby Vision Standard goes
over HDMI as 8-bit RGB that carries the 12-bit 4:2:2 picture and its
metadata, on every driver (nvidia-drm with "max bpc" 8, i915 and amdgpu
at the depth the tunnel sets).

During native output the row now reads "8 bits: Dolby Vision carries its
12 bits in them" (Estuary #32428; "8 bits: Dolby Vision lleva en ellos
sus 12 bits" in es_es, es_ar, es_mx): hades.out.depthkind "dv", set
where the page is fed (CWinSystemGbmGLESContext, native output being
m_dvSignalling, the same condition as the Transport row) on every
driver, and read first by HadesOutDepthVar in Estuary's Variables.xml
and in system/hades (made again by make-playerinfo.py). It says why
there are 8, and does not repeat the format that the Transport row
gives. HDR10, HDR10+, HLG and SDR show what they did.

Measured: the text is 522 and the Spanish 508 pixels wide in
NotoSans-Regular at the size of the row's font (font12, 25), in a row of
590. Checked: make-playerinfo.py --check, pi_check2.py and the strings
check. Not seen on a screen.
---
 .../language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po       |  6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po       |  6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po       |  6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po       |  6 ++++++
 addons/skin.estuary/xml/Variables.xml                 |  2 ++
 system/hades/HadesIncludes.xml                        |  1 +
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp        | 11 +++++++++++
 7 files changed, 38 insertions(+)

diff --git a/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po b/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
