 #: addons/skin.estuary/xml/Variables.xml
 #. Reason on the Dolby Vision page of the player information: its own HDR10+ metadata were chosen over its Dolby Vision ("With Dolby Vision and HDR10+ in one video", or the output chosen for the video)
